        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The Hand of Darkness is immune to any effect that would disjoint it from the Titan's body. This includes all teleportation effects such as <em>maze. </em>The Hand of Darkness can be Shoved and Pushed as normal. </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>The Hand of Darkness does not fall at the end of its turn if it does not use a Fly action. The Hand of Darkness does not fall if it becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}</p>"
        },
