        "category": "offensive",
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The Hand of Darkness flings a @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} creature into the air, up to 30 feet overhead and up to 30 feet away from the Hand (the creature takes damage from the fall as normal). If the flung creature lands on another creature, the creature it lands on takes the same amount of bludgeoning damage. The creature being landed on can attempt a @Check[type:reflex|dc:35|basic:true] save.</p>"
        },
