        "category": "offensive",
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>A cascading wave of shadow bursts from the Hand of Darkness in a @Template[type:cone|distance:20]. Each non-shadow creature in the area takes @Damage[8d6[mental]] damage and must succeed at a @Check[type:will|dc:34|basic:true] save with the following effects:</p><p><strong>Critical Success:</strong> The creature is unaffected</p><p><strong>Success:</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p><p><strong>Failure:</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round</p><p><strong>Critical Failure:</strong> The creature takes double damage and is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} for 1 minute and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2}</p>"
        },
